The <ansi fg="command">badcommands</ansi> command shows unrecognized player input.

<ansi fg="command">badcommands</ansi>
Displays a table of all unrecognized commands players have typed
and how many times each was attempted. Useful for finding missing
commands or common typos.

<ansi fg="command">badcommands clear</ansi>
Clears the bad command tracker and resets all counts.
